              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Samueli yaamugarukamu ati: Noogira ngu MUKAMA naashemerererwa ebitambo by'okwotsya n'ebindi bitambo, nk'oku ashemerererwa okworobera eiraka rye? Manya okworoba kukira ebitambo, n'okuhurira kukira ebishaju by'empaya z'entaama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka obugomi ni nk'ekibi ky'oburogo, n'obugangaazi ni nk'okuramya ebishushani na baateraafi. Nk'oku oyangire ekigambo kya MUKAMA, nawe ayangire ku oguma aha ngoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
