          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Samueli yaagira ati: Mundeetere aha Agagi, omugabe w'Abaamaleki. Agagi yaija ahu ari naanyimbanyimba; yaagira ati: Buzimazima obushaarizi bw'okufa bwahweire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samueli yaagira ati: Nk'oku rurara yaawe yaahindwire abakazi encwekye, nikwo na nyoko yaaza kuhinduka encwekye omu bakazi. Samueli yaatemagurira Agagi omu maisho ga MUKAMA Gilugaali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
